<title>UK: LME nickel ends sharply lower, others lacklustre.</title>
<headline>LME nickel ends sharply lower, others lacklustre.</headline>
<text>
<p>NICKEL - Ends PM kerb with deep losses at around $7,300 on disappointed liquidation and technical selling.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Gives up most gains, settles barely firmer.</p>
<p>COPPER - Slightly weaker, but above $2,500.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Barely changed.</p>
</text>
